<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">13092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A tanker's been struck by a projectile inside the Strait of Hormuz itself — the first reported hit within the channel rather than the waters around it.</s> <s>The UK Maritime Trade Operations centre logged the incident without a vessel name or flag, and about a fifth of the world's seaborne oil moves through shipping lanes barely two miles wide.</s> <s>War-risk insurers reprice voyages off those advisories, not off barrels actually lost... so the cost lands long before any cargo does.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Swedes voted today in an election that could put the Sweden Democrats, a party grown from the white-nationalist movement of the nineteen-eighties, inside government for the first time.</s> <s>Jimmie Akesson's party has shaped migration and policing policy since twenty twenty-two without holding a single ministry, because Sweden's proportional system makes coalition arithmetic everything and a kingmaker needs no portfolio.</s> <s>What's at stake now isn't popularity, which the party already has, but whether the cordon that kept it out of cabinet finally falls — and what that means for the roughly eight hundred thousand Swedish residents born in Muslim-majority countries.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bahrain won't take its seat at Monday's talks in Muscat on the security of the Strait of Hormuz, because it cut ties with Tehran a decade ago and wants them restored first.</s> <s>Oman hosts because it's the only Gulf state that's kept channels to Iran open through every rupture — mediation is a capability, and it's unevenly distributed.</s> <s>Any real Hormuz arrangement would have to cover transit notification, escort rules and war-risk zones, and none of it works without the state that hosts the American Fifth Fleet.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Afghan woman with lawful permanent residency has been removed from the United States in the first ever use of the Alien Terrorist Removal Court, a body Congress created in nineteen ninety-six and then left unused for thirty years.</s> <s>Nazira Haji Zada, forty-seven, conceded removal rather than contest evidence she was never permitted to see, in a proceeding where the defence receives a summary instead of the record.</s> <s>She's gone to Afghanistan under Taliban rule, and the precedent set is that a green card no longer places anyone beyond that court's reach.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two Nigerian men were killed in South Africa, among them Bishop Michael Taiwo Fakunle, shot at his Johannesburg home after a series of threats he'd reported beforehand.</s> <s>Roughly eight hundred thousand Nigerians and other African migrants live in an economy with the world's highest measured unemployment, where organised movements have spent years offering migrants as the explanation for it.</s> <s>Nigeria's former foreign minister says eight Nigerians have died in South Africa this year, most at the hands of police — and the unanswered question is what was done between the threats and the shooting.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Labour Party figure has taken the University of Nigeria at Nsukka to court for refusing to release Peter Obi's academic records.</s> <s>Nigeria's Freedom of Information Act obliges public bodies to answer within seven days, but universities have spent a decade arguing they aren't covered and the courts have split — so the statute is being litigated into existence one respondent at a time.</s> <s>Credential disputes have shadowed Nigerian elections before, and they fester because the custodian of the records, not the candidate, is the chokepoint.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Newsrooms have quietly retreated from the word terrorist, writing gunman or armed group instead, while governments have moved the other way and written the judgement into statute.</s> <s>A designation is an administrative act made before any adversarial test, and it unlocks asset freezes, secret evidence and removal without an ordinary hearing — so the word isn't a description, it's a switch.</s> <s>British and American law now reaches nonviolent protest movements with it, and those affected must contest the label after it's already been thrown.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran used Chinese satellite imagery to target an American air base in Jordan, officials told the Wall Street Journal, in a July strike that killed three <sub alias="U.S.">US</sub> troops at Muwaffaq Salti.</s> <s>The imagery came from unnamed commercial entities rather than the Chinese state, which is the distinction Beijing will rest on and the one that matters least to the targeting.</s> <s>High-resolution overhead imagery used to be the possession of a handful of governments — it's now a product, and that changes who can aim.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sixteen of twenty-six residents died in a fire at a private nursing home in Pitrufquen, southern Chile.</s> <s>Elderly residents can't evacuate themselves, so survival rests entirely on staffing levels and drills — and the municipality had asked for an inspection back in February, after citing the home for violations dating to twenty nineteen.</s> <s>Chile's president has promised answers, though the request that went unanswered is already on the record.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iraqi forces say they've seized the launch platform used to strike Saudi Arabia's east-west pipeline, tracing it to Tayeb Island in Maysan province.</s> <s>That line exists precisely so Saudi crude can bypass Hormuz, and drones launched from Iraqi soil defeat the hedge by putting both export routes within reach of a single actor.</s> <s>Baghdad has sacked Maysan's security chiefs but named no one — and a state that holds the launcher while naming no suspect has answered only half the question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sam Altman has ruled out an OpenAI listing this year, telling Fortune that public markets would make it harder to put safety ahead of shareholders.</s> <s>The company was weeks from filing, and going public would have brought a fiduciary duty and a quarterly disclosure cadence that turns a delayed model into an actionable disappointment.</s> <s>Whether the frontier labs are financed privately or publicly decides who's ever permitted to see their numbers — and for now, nobody outside is.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bitcoin Suisse is cutting sixty jobs in Zug, the town that built its reputation selling regulatory quality as worth Swiss wages.</s> <s>Europe's new crypto-licensing regime now grants the market access a Swiss licence once did, and it grants it at Bratislava salaries.</s> <s>The licensed Swiss entity stays on paper while a Vietnam hub comes next... which is what a regulatory premium looks like when it stops being scarce.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Larry Ellison scrapped a fifty-million-share sale one day after disclosing it.</s> <s>Pre-set trading plans exist to prove a sale wasn't driven by inside information, so cancelling one converts an automatic act back into a discretionary one — and cancellations disclose far less than the sales they replace.</s> <s>Oracle is financing enormous artificial-intelligence data-centre commitments, which is the context any reader should hold beside that reversal.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Sixteen people have died from illicit liquor in Sagar district, Madhya Pradesh, with nineteen in custody.</s> <s>Hooch deaths are methanol deaths, and methanol is nearly harmless until the liver's alcohol dehydrogenase turns it into formic acid over twelve to twenty-four hours — which is why victims arrive feeling well and go blind or die later.</s> <s>The antidote is fomepizole, or remarkably, ethanol itself, both of which occupy that same enzyme — so whether a district hospital stocks either decides most of a cohort.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japan's Hayabusa-two has ranged an asteroid by laser without any reflector on its surface.</s> <s>Lunar laser ranging works because Apollo and Soviet missions left mirrors behind; the asteroid Torifune has none, so the probe measured distance directly while flying past at kilometres per second on the fifth of July.</s> <s>Direct ranging sharpens orbit forecasts for bodies we can only visit once.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London have traced chronic dry mouth to cells under sustained stress rather than to tissue that's died.</s> <s>Radiotherapy, Sjogren's syndrome and diabetes all damage the glands that make saliva, and for a cancer patient the result can end the ability to eat.</s> <s>Living-but-stressed cells are a target current drugs don't address — if the pathway holds up, that's a treatable failure rather than a permanent loss.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Apple's new iPhone Duo starts at one thousand nine hundred ninety-nine dollars, or close to three hundred thousand rupees in India.</s> <s>American carriers bury that price in thirty-six months of bill credits, a consumer loan with an early-termination penalty that most markets simply don't offer — so in Karachi, Lagos or Jakarta the same device is bought outright, in cash.</s> <s>Preorders open in October, and the upmarket move quietly widens a gap between a rounding error and a month's salary.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Frank Kendall, until recently the Pentagon's chief weapons buyer, argues in a new book that machines should be permitted to decide some strikes alone.</s> <s>His reasoning is electronic warfare, not ideology: a datalink back to a human operator is the first thing any adversary attacks, so when links fail the machine either decides or is useless.</s> <s>No doctrine yet answers who the defendant is when such a system kills the wrong people — and the systems are already flying over Yemen, Gaza and the Sahel.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A chatbot described in Nature converts plain questions into database queries with no large language model involved at all.</s> <s>A grammar-constrained parser can only emit valid queries against a closed, fixed vocabulary, whereas a language model can emit fluent ones that are wrong.</s> <s>Not every problem needs a frontier model — and that's an unfashionable finding worth carrying.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>